  AUTHORIZED --> CAPTURED: Merchant full capture / hold remains
  CAPTURED --> CLEARED: Batch accepted / posted debit replaces hold
  CLEARED --> SETTLED: Batch reconciled / proceeds + fee allocations
  DECLINED --> [*]
  SETTLED --> [*]
